# In .env.local, add the standard OpenAI server key named OPENAI_API_KEY.
# Without it, the guide uses verified portfolio answers.
# OPENAI_MODEL optionally overrides the default model (gpt-5.6-luna, low reasoning).
# OPENAI_EMBEDDING_MODEL optionally overrides the embedding model used by
# `pnpm rag:embed` and the guide's resume RAG retrieval (default text-embedding-3-small).
# GUIDE_RAG_TOP_K optionally changes how many knowledge chunks are merged (default 4).
# TYPESAFE_API_KEY optionally enables Jev (TypeSafe System One) retrieval: one
# call ranks every knowledge chunk by calibrated probability and gates
# out-of-scope questions. Without it, embedding retrieval is used.
# TYPESAFE_MODEL optionally overrides the Jev model name (default jev-latest).
# GUIDE_DEBUG=1 adds a `trace` field (retrieval engine, on-topic score,
# per-node timings, session state) to /api/guide responses — local debugging only.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL optionally sets the canonical site origin used for
# Open Graph image URLs. On Vercel, VERCEL_URL is used automatically.
